        {
          "kind": "wait",
          "time": 1000,
          "noSkip": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "嗚哇！？修卡的襲擊嗎！讓我來解決這件事吧！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "叮叮叮噔噔，覺醒吧，我的超能！[梗平擺出空我變身動作]",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "不好意思，沒想到有人會在這個時間參拜……沒事嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "哇！？你就是怪人女幹部嗎！那些東西一瞬間消失了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_serious_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "吾名為…綿貫咲耶，是這個神社的巫女",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "方才的東西是吾準備在神社祭典使用的舞台投影…有嚇到你嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "原來是投影嗎！嚇了我一跳啊…",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "但是……怎麼投影結束了，神社還是充滿陰森氣氛的…",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "這裡是「神孕花之神社」，掌管結緣與……",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "結緣與？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "安息的地方，這位異鄉人。因此一般鮮有參拜者特意光臨呢…",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "掌管「結緣」與「安息」的神明嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "和島根縣「出雲大社」的主祭神一樣，是供奉大國主大神喔～",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "原來如此……我說！完全沒解釋為什麼這麼陰森吧？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "在異鄉人眼中看起來陰森嗎？吾不這麼認為呢……是認知差異嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "咳咳，這次就當我走錯地方吧！我叫梗平！不是什麼異鄉人，那麼再見！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "梗平先生呢…明白了，期待你得到良緣與……休息之時。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "[梗平小跑著離開，不時回頭確認那座神社是真實的存在，感到莫名的寒意。]"
        },
        {
          "kind": "function.call",
          "function": "function () {\n\tcore.plugin.completeAkibaEvent('watanuki_sakuya_1');\n}"
        },
