      "events": [
        {
          "kind": "layout.set",
          "value": {
            "avg": true,
            "position": "down",
            "offset": 0,
            "align": "left",
            "bold": true,
            "background": "winskin.png",
            "title": [
              255,
              225,
              80,
              1
            ],
            "text": [
              255,
              255,
              255,
              1
            ],
            "titlefont": 22,
            "textfont": 16,
            "lineHeight": 22,
            "time": 10,
            "letterSpacing": 0,
            "animateTime": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "[不知道是迷霧還是精神不佳影響，梗平朦朧間走到了神社附近]"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "梗平先生，沒想到你又來了呢？是想締結良緣還是想為誰祈求冥福呢？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "不，只是因為匆忙製作的騎士系統導致我身體菠蘿菠蘿噠…被恐懼心驅使前往這裡",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "欸……吾有點聽不懂梗平先生在說什麼呢～",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_surprised.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "忘了吧，那個不重要的。簡單來說就是我為了向神明祈求得到強化形態而來。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "強化形態是指……？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "是為了邁向人生新篇章的必經之路！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "啊，其實是我打算抽假面騎士新的一番賞所以來這裡求保佑啦！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "原來如此，是為了提升運勢而到神社求福呢…吾理解了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "正是如此！有那樣的護身符或儀式之類的嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "關於那點…可能沒有相似的東西呢……",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "啊，對了，有乾花製的護身符，可能會有作用吧？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "ＴＡＴＯＢＡ！就是慾望硬幣！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
          "text": "硬幣嗎？那麼這個以「紅色蝴蝶蘭」為基底的護身符很適合梗平先生呢。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "choice",
          "prompt": "要怎麼回應？",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "購買",
              "events": [
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "巫女小姐誠意推薦！我當然會買吧！就要這個吧！",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "嗯嗯，紅色蝴蝶蘭的花語主要為「仕途順暢」與「鴻運當頭」～",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "哦哦！很吉祥的花呢！",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "嗯嗯，如果能幫到梗平先生就好了呢。",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "[梗平買了護身符就去抽新的假面騎士一番賞，結果沒中想要的Ａ賞，但中了Ｂ賞還算不錯。]"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "不購買",
              "events": [
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "果然依賴神力護體萬萬不可！巫女小姐，我決定用人類姿態挑戰！",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "那真是遺憾呢…",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "但是一場來到，就讓我去投些香火錢做個儀式吧！",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "原來如此，參拜之儀呢，那麼這邊請……投下任意金錢後合掌三拜默念就可以了。",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "哦！就用這枚５００日圓吧！（帥氣的ＯＯＯ取硬幣動作）",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "ＯＲＡ！（合掌三拜默念一氣呵成）",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "呼，真是有趣的人呢…令我想起一位朋友了。",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_smile.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "這樣就行了嗎？",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 10,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "綿貫咲耶",
                  "text": "這樣就可以了，祝你緣份已至。",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "watanuki_sakuya_normal.png"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "[梗平滿懷歡喜地去抽一番賞……雖然沒有A賞，]"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "[但是意外地用較少抽數得到了最終賞，即異色A賞。]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "function.call",
          "function": "function () {\n\tcore.plugin.completeAkibaEvent('watanuki_sakuya_2');\n}"
        },
        {
